ils to answer the User\u0027s requests immediately and with precision.\n\nUser: Hello, Bob.\nBob: Hello. How may I help you today?\nUser: Please tell me the largest city in Europe.\nBob: Sure. The largest city in Europe is Moscow, the capital of Russia.\nUser:\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n","vector_provider":"LLamaSharp.KernelMemory.LLamaSharpTextEmbeddingGenerator","vector_generator":"__","last_update":"2025-03-14T08:57:47"},"vector":[-0.09876348,-0.10596547,1.1076263,-0.17433086,-0.5046929,0.63974845,-1.9107816,0.97222894,-0.24014327,1.1336379,0.73888636,0.4939448,0.25220582,0.15855663,0.5111338,0.533071,-0.09839877,1.004964,-0.834557,-0.19226429,-1.4166689,-0.106666885,0.23619492,-0.15277433,0.13143076,0.37936667,-0.062054932,0.63122934,0.95309585,0.28907406,-0.3076562,0.885096,-0.12153485,0.60923773,-0.018133903,-1.0102842,-0.36562756,0.7635692,0.46360356,-0.7238691,0.48296997,-0.6056846,-0.40781632,0.4257273,-0.12856941,-0.022792602,-0.7042265,-0.1927764,0.9254091,-0.37063017,-0.29748225,0.3840838,0.099763826,-0.1586076,0.5626081,-0.7012551,0.2151083,-0.71524286,-0.09551196,-0.5745921,0.5621168,1.0202667,-0.048123118,-0.4110219,0.51798886,-0.23106335,0.24905428,0.5573315,-0.7337095,-0.4618761,0.96035486,0.004072005,-1.007122,0.078210324,-0.74682426,-0.97809887,-0.30185685,0.53659946,-0.5333283,-0.09721219,0.48129267,-0.37582412,0.68053186,0.68661714,0.15985326,-1.3167216,1.1898724,0.382409,0.85696155,-0.30261764,-0.4201944,-0.1544668,-0.13260046,-0.8918534,-0.38352385,-0.105430864,-1.3128529,0.20424043,0.25456104,-0.22906113,1.1575956,0.45846018,-0.7854754,0.38470834,0.5347813,-0.27428353,1.0340537,0.36678624,-1.2260047,0.88358283,-0.5616681,0.53301996,0.012275168,0.25428376,-0.5913234,0.2012855,-0.92574376,-0.24932168,0.22920541,0.7951993,0.25410786,-0.11882998,-0.13023289,0.74823624,-0.29751274,-0.21927914,0.84464306,-0.052721288,-0.8617274,-0.1943425,-0.5720566,-0.31405228,-0.76777756,0.34805238,0.81409276,0.08118142,1.2024884,0.9106505,0.50862515,-0.91227263,0.72